    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description:\r\n\r\nThe Old Rectory, N91 DKH2, is a generous Victorian family home constructed c.1870 with a range of outbuildings and set on c.2 acres of landscaped gardens. The light filled spacious living accommodation is laid out over two floors with many original features throughout. Refurbished and reroofed over the last 20 years this wonderful property offers exceptional family accommodation with scope for further development in the detached two storey outbuildings to the rear.\r\n\r\nSituated c.300m off the R392 on the outskirts of Moyvore Village, 15 mins from Mullingar Town, 10 mins from Ballymahon & 20 mins from Athlone there are a host of services and amenities on it’s doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe entrance porch leads to a generous entrance hall with two receptions rooms on either side to the front and leading back to a Guest WC, a laundry room and a large kitchen / breakfast room. The first floor consists of 4 double bedrooms (main en-suite) together with a family bathroom white a further separate bedroom & en-suite is located to the rear of the first floor. The residence extends to c.250 sq.m. of living accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside the detached outbuildings extend to c.125 sq.m over two floors and offer considerable scope for further development.   \r\n\r\nThe gardens together with a separate paddock extend to c.2 acres and have been carefully maintained and landscaped.\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
